# Default MSBuild arguments applied to all builds
# Note: dotnet build enables parallel builds by default (overrides /m:1).
# -graph enables static graph evaluation for proper project dependency ordering,
# preventing file-locking races when multiple projects compile in parallel.
-graph
/nodeReuse:false
-p:BuildInParallel=false
-p:MSBuildBuildInParallel=false
-p:ProduceReferenceAssembly=false